WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.488 --> 00:00:16.137
At the sight of the trolls, Zann grabbed Zing and zapped away.

2
00:00:16.837 --> 00:00:19.839
He landed near Wormwood, which reminded him of Wyssa.

3
00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:25.343
They needed to find her; she might be the only person who was powerful enough to stop Morb.

4
00:00:26.364 --> 00:00:30.106
There was a flash as Perda, Darb, and Gliss zapped into view.

5
00:00:30.126 --> 00:00:32.008
"Good!" Zann said.

6
00:00:32.596 --> 00:00:34.417
"I didn't know if you guys would get out of there."

7
00:00:34.977 --> 00:00:35.738
He looked around.

8
00:00:35.758 --> 00:00:37.279
"Where's Mari?"

9
00:00:38.039 --> 00:00:39.060
Perda shook her head.

10
00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:41.321
"She zapped out on her own.

11
00:00:41.821 --> 00:00:46.244
I barely had time to grab Darb and Gliss before zapping out of the lab."

12
00:00:46.264 --> 00:00:48.525
"How'd you find me so fast?"

13
00:00:48.865 --> 00:00:49.546
Zann asked.

14
00:00:50.246 --> 00:00:50.907
Perda grinned.

15
00:00:50.927 --> 00:00:52.768
"I learned a new spell."

16
00:00:52.788 --> 00:00:55.249
"Is it some sort of Tracking spell?"

17
00:00:55.729 --> 00:00:56.670
Zann was intrigued.

18
00:00:56.690 --> 00:01:00.272
"It's called a Uniting spell," Perda said.

19
00:01:00.928 --> 00:01:03.931
"I read about it in a book about magic from other worlds.

20
00:01:04.411 --> 00:01:08.034
The spell can only be used to find someone who wants to be found."

21
00:01:08.054 --> 00:01:10.576
"Can you use the spell to find Wyssa?"

22
00:01:10.856 --> 00:01:11.457
Zann asked.

23
00:01:12.077 --> 00:01:12.677
Perda shrugged.

24
00:01:12.698 --> 00:01:13.878
"I can try."

25
00:01:14.739 --> 00:01:17.822
She rubbed her hands against her forehead and closed her eyes.

26
00:01:18.762 --> 00:01:21.705
Then she muttered a few words that Zann couldn't hear.

27
00:01:22.786 --> 00:01:24.567
Perda opened her eyes and looked around.

28
00:01:24.587 --> 00:01:27.009
"Sorry, it's not working."

29
00:01:27.029 --> 00:01:30.632
"I guess Wyssa doesn't want to be found," Darb said.

30
00:01:31.452 --> 00:01:32.253
Zann sighed.

31
00:01:32.273 --> 00:01:34.334
"We need to find her."

32
00:01:35.054 --> 00:01:36.115
Gliss glanced around.

33
00:01:36.135 --> 00:01:38.456
"We're pretty close to Wormwood.

34
00:01:38.896 --> 00:01:40.577
Maybe someone there has seen her."

35
00:01:40.597 --> 00:01:42.758
"Let's go," Zann said.

36
00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:48.341
When they arrived at Wormwood, a familiar voice called out.

37
00:01:48.361 --> 00:01:51.463
"Don't bother walking any farther!"

38
00:01:51.923 --> 00:01:52.544
It was Hap.

39
00:01:53.324 --> 00:01:54.064
Zann stopped.

40
00:01:54.965 --> 00:01:55.465
"Why not?"

41
00:01:55.485 --> 00:01:57.126
"You can't get in."

42
00:01:57.706 --> 00:01:59.888
Hap waved a hand toward the collection of huts.

43
00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:03.482
"Someone put a spell over the whole place.

44
00:02:04.322 --> 00:02:07.064
I can't even get in to check on my valuables!"

45
00:02:07.084 --> 00:02:11.007
"Why would someone put a spell over Wormwood?"

46
00:02:11.307 --> 00:02:11.907
Perda asked.

47
00:02:11.927 --> 00:02:14.869
"I don't know," Hap grumbled.

48
00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:17.151
Zann took another step forward.

49
00:02:17.911 --> 00:02:19.713
He couldn't see any sort of shield.

50
00:02:20.553 --> 00:02:22.314
Suddenly his leg became stuck.

51
00:02:22.334 --> 00:02:24.556
"Hey!" Zann cried.

52
00:02:25.136 --> 00:02:28.879
It felt as if he'd stepped into a wall of gooey glowberry pudding.

53
00:02:29.599 --> 00:02:30.260
"What's wrong?"

54
00:02:30.616 --> 00:02:32.418
Perda rushed forward and then stopped.

55
00:02:32.438 --> 00:02:35.220
"Ack! I'm stuck too!"

56
00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:36.841
"Pull us out!"

57
00:02:37.222 --> 00:02:38.623
Zann called to Gliss and Darb.

58
00:02:38.643 --> 00:02:40.504
"Don't come too close though."

59
00:02:42.566 --> 00:02:47.170
"I warned you," Hap said once Zann and Perda were freed.

60
00:02:48.131 --> 00:02:50.533
Zann rubbed his leg, which still felt sticky.

61
00:02:50.553 --> 00:02:53.015
"What a weird spell."

62
00:02:53.035 --> 00:02:57.399
"I already sent a message moth to Laddno to alert him."

63
00:02:58.199 --> 00:02:58.800
Hap chuckled.

64
00:02:59.552 --> 00:03:01.053
"He'll be our king soon.

65
00:03:01.613 --> 00:03:04.094
He might as well get to work now, right?"

66
00:03:04.114 --> 00:03:07.315
"Do you really think he'll win the election?"

67
00:03:07.615 --> 00:03:08.276
Zann asked.

68
00:03:09.056 --> 00:03:09.776
Hap shrugged.

69
00:03:10.536 --> 00:03:11.157
"I don't know.

70
00:03:11.817 --> 00:03:15.038
But I hear he's going to bring in extra magic energy.

71
00:03:15.638 --> 00:03:20.120
Soon we'll all have enough magic to create our own palaces!"

72
00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:23.382
"Is Laddno really telling people that?"

73
00:03:23.582 --> 00:03:24.242
Gliss asked.

74
00:03:24.262 --> 00:03:26.383
"I doubt it's true."

75
00:03:27.183 --> 00:03:27.703
"Never mind."

76
00:03:28.103 --> 00:03:29.184
Zann tugged on her arm.

77
00:03:29.996 --> 00:03:30.416
"Let's go."

78
00:03:31.217 --> 00:03:34.620
It was starting to get dark, so the kids returned to Teplo's place.

79
00:03:35.441 --> 00:03:36.521
Fala was waiting for them.

80
00:03:36.541 --> 00:03:38.823
"Good news," she said.

81
00:03:38.843 --> 00:03:42.686
"Many people think Venna will win the vote easily tomorrow."

82
00:03:43.387 --> 00:03:44.208
Gliss smiled.

83
00:03:44.228 --> 00:03:47.911
"Once Venna is queen, she's sure to release the prisoners."

84
00:03:47.931 --> 00:03:52.314
"And then she can help us figure out what to do about Morb," Perda said.

85
00:03:52.334 --> 00:03:54.436
"Right," Fala said.

86
00:03:54.456 --> 00:03:59.140
"Now let's all get some rest, and we'll deal with everything else tomorrow."

87
00:04:01.324 --> 00:04:06.826
The next day the kids came out of the hatch and found a large, multicolored toad waiting for

88
00:04:06.866 --> 00:04:08.486
them. "Vote!

89
00:04:09.446 --> 00:04:11.467
Vote!" it croaked loudly.

90
00:04:11.487 --> 00:04:14.088
"We know," Zann said with a smile.

91
00:04:14.908 --> 00:04:17.749
He touched the toad on the head, and his fingers tingled.

92
00:04:18.569 --> 00:04:22.490
A second later the toad spit out a voting ballot with Zann's name on it.

93
00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:26.251
Zann picked it up and magically inscribed "Venna" on it.

94
00:04:26.871 --> 00:04:32.167
Then he tossed it to the toad, which caught it on its long tongue and gulped it down.

95
00:04:33.308 --> 00:04:37.351
One by one, Zann's friends and Fala cast their votes the same way.

96
00:04:38.272 --> 00:04:41.955
Vote toads had been in charge of elections ever since Zann could remember.

97
00:04:42.675 --> 00:04:46.178
Up and down the street, he could see other people voting through other toads.

98
00:04:47.059 --> 00:04:52.763
Once every vote in Magica had been swallowed, the toads would gather in the palace square to present

99
00:04:52.803 --> 00:04:53.364
the results.

100
00:04:54.188 --> 00:04:56.149
"What should we do for the rest of the day?"

101
00:04:56.569 --> 00:04:59.610
Gliss said as the toad hopped off in search of more voters.

102
00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:00.930
Perda shrugged.

103
00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:03.091
"Let's look for Wyssa again."

104
00:05:04.571 --> 00:05:07.172
They spent the next few hours wandering around the city.

105
00:05:07.992 --> 00:05:11.013
Vote toads were everywhere, and so were voters.

106
00:05:11.773 --> 00:05:14.454
Everyone seemed excited that the election was here at last.

107
00:05:15.174 --> 00:05:17.955
Eventually the kids wandered past the palace square.

108
00:05:18.715 --> 00:05:20.656
There were no trolls in sight at the moment.

109
00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:25.723
Only one vote toad was there, accepting votes from several palace workers.

110
00:05:26.483 --> 00:05:31.366
Then the door opened and Laddno hurried out, flanked by a pair of trolls.

111
00:05:31.386 --> 00:05:33.487
"I'd like to vote, please!"

112
00:05:33.928 --> 00:05:37.650
he announced loudly, pushing past a woman who was about to touch the toad.

113
00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:42.172
The toad croaked, casting a wary eye toward the trolls.

114
00:05:43.053 --> 00:05:44.814
Laddno patted the toad on the head.

115
00:05:45.554 --> 00:05:48.096
He wrote on his ballot in large, glowing letters.

116
00:05:48.904 --> 00:05:52.185
Then he tossed it back to the toad, which gulped it quickly.

117
00:05:52.205 --> 00:05:53.606
"Thank you!"

118
00:05:54.206 --> 00:05:58.048
Laddno glanced around at the palace workers as if he expected applause.

119
00:05:58.808 --> 00:06:02.490
When nobody said anything, he frowned and went back into the palace.

120
00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:05.191
The trolls remained in the square.

121
00:06:05.211 --> 00:06:08.192
"Let's get out of here," Zann whispered.

122
00:06:08.212 --> 00:06:13.594
"We haven't found Wyssa, so let's go to Venna's campaign headquarters to hear the election results."

123
00:06:15.335 --> 00:06:19.801
Later they waited with Fala, Venna, Maff, and various other adults.

124
00:06:20.541 --> 00:06:24.182
Finally a glowing image of a vote toad appeared in the sky.

125
00:06:24.963 --> 00:06:31.425
The toad's tongue flicked out, inscribing a number beside a picture of Venna and another number beside a

126
00:06:31.465 --> 00:06:32.306
picture of Laddno.

127
00:06:33.066 --> 00:06:35.947
A gasp went up from the crowd.

128
00:06:36.967 --> 00:06:38.348
Laddno had won!
